title: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Import a file with field mapping
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (Intake, and the documents row of Clinical documentation)
intro: Import an export from any record system. A CSV or XLSX file goes through a field-mapping step: each column on the left, a Psyflo field on the right, guessed from the header and the first row, any column can be skipped. A PDF is read as a document. Cells copied from a spreadsheet can be pasted the same way. The file is read in the browser and never uploaded.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'Use a sample export' loads a built-in CSV of three invented patients. A PDF's reading is simulated and says so.
---
start s1 "Click 'Import a file'"
overlay o1 "Drop zone 'Choose or drop a CSV, XLSX or PDF export'\nLink 'Use a sample export'"
input i1 "Drop a file, or click and choose one"
click c1 "Click 'Use a sample export'"
input iPaste "Or paste cells copied from a spreadsheet (Ctrl+V)"
decision dKind "What kind of file?"
process pCsv "CSV or tab-separated text is read as a table\nQuoted cells, commas and line breaks inside cells are kept"
process pXlsx "XLSX: the first sheet is read in the browser\nDate cells are read as dates"
process pPdf "PDF: read as a document\nIts title comes from the file name"
wait wPdf "'Reading patients.pdf…', about one second"
process pImg "An image goes the screenshot way"
goto gShot "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Paste a screenshot"
toast tBad "'notes.docx is not a CSV, XLSX, PDF or image.'\nor 'Could not read X. Save it as CSV and try again.'"

group gMap "Field mapping"
  screen sMap "'patients-export.csv' · 12 columns · 3 rows · 11 mapped\nColumn | First row | Psyflo field"
  process pGuess "Each column is guessed from its header ('DOB' to Date of birth, 'Primary payer' to Payer)\nthen from the first row's value (an ICD-10 code, a payer's name)\n'MRN' has no Psyflo field: Skip"
  input iRow "Pick 'Row 2 · R.D.' when the export has several patients"
  input iField "Change a field, or choose 'Skip'\nA field can be used by one column only"
  click cApply "Click 'Apply mapping'"
  click cCancel "Click 'Cancel'"
endgroup
process pRead "Values are read into Psyflo's form\nPayer name to the payer, 'Intensive outpatient' to IOP, '06/14/1989' to a date\n'Last note' and 'Prior dx' become documents"
toast tUnread "A value that cannot be read is listed as not used\ne.g. 'Payer: “Acme Health”: not a payer in Psyflo'"
goto gReview "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Review what was found and apply"

s1 --> o1
o1 --> i1 --> dKind
o1 --> c1 --> pCsv
o1 --> iPaste --> pCsv
dKind -->|CSV| pCsv
dKind -->|XLSX| pXlsx
dKind -->|PDF| pPdf --> wPdf --> gReview
dKind -->|Image| pImg --> gShot
dKind -->|Other, or unreadable| tBad
pCsv --> sMap
pXlsx --> sMap
sMap --> pGuess --> iRow --> iField --> cApply --> pRead --> gReview
pRead -.-> tUnread
sMap --> cCancel --> o1
